### ==== ##### == # == STARTPUNKT SYSTEM-AXIOMEN == # == ##### === ###

NAME Ð SYSTEM-AXOIMEN

 MORPHIC-ID ¡ SAX

MASTER § MASU-

 BEGRIFFDEFINITION =

